com,"ej,donlm101,P,emslb101,Fair/foul call (Reversed)"
com,"$Donlin ejected by HP umpire Emslie for arguing when"
com,"umpire reversed his call of a foul ball. On the pitch"
com,"Seymour started to steal second and Devlin apparently"
com,"foul-tipped the ball. Emslie distinctly called 'foul'"
com,"and Seymour stopped running and was tagged out when"
com,"catcher threw to 2nd. During ensuing argument Emslie"
com,"claimed he had said 'strike' (not 'foul')."
