com,"play,9,1,brida101,??,,S8.1-2;3-H"
com,"$Bridwell singled to CF to apparently score the"
com,"winning run. Merkle failed to run to 2B on the play"
com,"and the Cubs insisted that Merkle was out on a force"
com,"at 2B. HP umpire O'Day declared Merkle out but the"
com,"game could not be continued due to all the fans on the"
com,"field. National League President Harry Pulliam declared"
com,"the game a tie and needed to be replayed."
